* New ht9045_iosetview_formshow_c.js: GET /api/form/HW.IoSetView.html (C++ FileRW/IoSetViewFormShow_File.cpp, golden
  iosetview.cpp:236-1023 + ShowSuckMode / ShowShuttleSensor / LabSiteMap / Hide_1032_IO) applied at load and every window open:
  13 tabs hidden / 2 shown, 167 hidden / 33 shown components, colours, captions, enabled; chkShowIndexAll as a WS form.event
  (golden :1760); the 16-sucker panels placed as golden ctor :55-62 (they were 450 px off).
