  2 characters and overriding Type / Lane, :3066-3875); sbUpdate saves without asking (golden :3183); ht9045_io_do.js lbSuckEnabled.
* New ht9045_hsys_events_c.js: btnSetATCCom 15 COM defaults, the function search, ExitBtn right-click -> Customer Code tab,
  pcSetting OnChange, edtSearchCode, rgCustomerList, rgTTLCard / rgRotateKit_Type click logic (also replayed in C++ before save).
* New ht9045_ltcsensor_c.js: groups as golden FormShow :82-102, live servo LEDs; ht9045_unported_form_c.js /
  ht9045_iosetview_unwired_c.js: Omron / CCLink / GroundMan monitor / latch / ADAM controls greyed with golden's handler + reason.
* Engine GB_NO_ASK + GroundMan (golden GroundMan.cpp:1418), merged three-way with the live engine (setupA + motorB entries kept).
C++ side: machine 58f1886 (cherry-pick of the helper's a2d1e0a).

Verified: syntax OK (16 scripts); o2 wb_serve 0 errors; ctest IoSetViewFormShowBridge (35), HSys_HeaterMix (149),
EBoot005_CustomerName, TeachFormShowBridge, WebPageTable, WebMotorAccess 6/6; helper's headless Edge: 7 pages 0 errors, IO page
373 FormShow states applied / 0 missing; production_audit 0 changes.

